# BUG-20 reproduction: valley-shaped knife z = 0.5 + |x - 0.5| (use with
# bug09_clay.obj, the unit cube). Normals point up (+z). The sub-faces of the
# cube's front and back faces are bounded by intersection lines from both
# triangles; above the valley on the y=0 face is a triangle of area 0.25.

v  0.5 -6  0.5
v  0.5  6  0.5
v -5.5  0  6.5
v  6.5  0  6.5

f 1 2 3
f 1 4 2
